conicxx links against QDLDL unmodified (src/conicxx/kkt/qdldl_ldlt.cpp) when
built with CONICXX_WITH_QDLDL=ON (the default; fetched via CMake FetchContent,
see CMakeLists.txt).

src/conicxx/kkt/regularized_ldlt.cpp additionally reuses QDLDL's elimination-
tree/triangular-solve routines unmodified and adapts QDLDL_factor's numeric
factorization loop (inserting per-pivot dynamic regularization in place of the
original's abort-on-zero-pivot behavior); see the license header at the top of
that file for the specific attribution and description of the modification.

